      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's better, definitely more detail there. \n\nActually, looking at the dashboard in the tool now, it's flagging that the summary score is still a bit low compared to other teams. It really needs a higher count of individual actionable items to get into the \"High Priority\" category on our dashboard.\n\nCan you take the whole list and really break it down? I don't want it to be useless, but it needs to be much more granular so the bullet count goes up. If you can turn each of those main points into a more detailed sequence of distinct steps, that would be perfect. It'll help the system pick it up as a high-effort task.",
